NAME
    gcloud apihub addons - manage Addon resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub addons COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Addon resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Describe an Addon.

     list
        List Addons.

     manage-config
        Manage the Config of an Addon.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub addons

